Apply order matters: rosetta, then online, then audio, then cng.
The online and cng patches both touch dlls/crypt32/pfx.c, and cng builds on the
result of online.  Applying them alphabetically -- the obvious thing to do with a
directory of patches -- produces a reject.  See README in this directory.

Aurora17 / FIFA 17 online: four Wine fixes, on top of crossover-26.3-fifa17-rosetta.patch.

  dlls/ntdll/unix/virtual.c   BUGS.md #9  VirtualQuery must not return an image region that
                                          crosses a PE section boundary
                              BUGS.md #12 a writable section with no raw data is demand-zero,
                                          not copy-on-write
  dlls/crypt32/pfx.c          BUGS.md #10 give every PFX import its own key container
  dlls/secur32/schannel.c     BUGS.md #11 fall back to exporting the private key from the
                                          certificate's provider

